;----------------------------
;Info for the dream
;======================
;DAILY_Lucid_Name: Name for the dream
;DAILY_Lucid_Desc: A description of the dream
;DAILY_Lucid_Type: Type of dream:
	;Normal
	;Nightmare
	;Sex
	;Pee
;DAILY_Lucid_CanDo: Requirements to do the dream
;DAILY_Lucid_NormalCom: Can do normal commands
;DAILY_Lucid_InterruptCom: What commands should be intercepted
;DAILY_Lucid_EndingAvailable: What endings are available.
;DAILY_Lucid_CanGiveUp: Whether you can give up in the dream (Bit System)
	;Pee: Bit 0 = Unpadded; Bit 1 = Diapered
;----------------------------
@LUCID_DREAM_INFO_21
#FUNCTION
DAILY_Lucid_Name '= "Another World"
DAILY_Lucid_Desc '= "You wake up to a modern western world, and now have to find a way to live in it."
DAILY_Lucid_Type '= "Normal"
DAILY_Lucid_CanDo = 1
DAILY_Lucid_NormalCom = 1
DAILY_Lucid_InterruptCom '= "400/405/811/"
DAILY_Lucid_EndingAvailable '= "62/"
DAILY_Lucid_CanGiveUp = 3

;----------------------------
;When you start up a dream
;----------------------------
@LUCID_DREAM_START_21
#DIM RandomChara
FOR RandomChara, 0, 7
	CALLF TP(DAILY_Lucid_Chara:RandomChara)
	TARGET:(RandomChara+1) = DAILY_Lucid_Chara:RandomChara
	CFLAG:(DAILY_Lucid_Chara:RandomChara):睡眠 = 0
	CFLAG:(DAILY_Lucid_Chara:RandomChara):同室 = 1
	TCVAR:(DAILY_Lucid_Chara:RandomChara):906 = 1		
	CALLF PEEME(DAILY_Lucid_Chara:RandomChara, 0)
	CALLF POOME(DAILY_Lucid_Chara:RandomChara, 0)		
NEXT
TFLAG:104 = DAILY_Lucid_Chara

BASE:MASTER:0 = MAXBASE:MASTER:0

IF DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1
CALLF PEEME(MASTER, 4)
ENDIF
IF DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2
CALLF POOME(MASTER, 4)
ENDIF	

PRINTFORMW You wake up to the side of a busy road.
PRINTFORMW You don't know how you got there but not only that, but you also realize people around you are wearing strange modern western clothes.
PRINTFORMW Others don't even look like humans at all!


;----------------------------
;Ending of the dream
;Can be good or bad
;----------------------------
@LUCID_DREAM_END_21

; ;When a command ends
; @LUCID_DREAM_TURN_21

;----------------------------
;Results for clicking on selections
;----------------------------
@LUCID_DREAM_INPUT_21(nInput)
#DIM nInput
SELECTCASE nInput
	CASE 1
		PRINTFORML Move to where?
		PRINTFORML [  0] - Streets
		PRINTFORML [  1] - Alleyway
		SIF nOmutsu
		PRINTFORML [  2] - A weird looking building
		PRINTFORML [  3] - Ornate room
		PRINTFORML [  4] - Go out
		PRINTFORML [999] - Stay where you are
		INPUT
		SELECTCASE RESULT
		CASE 1
		PRINTFORMW You scurry off between alleyways trying to find somewhere quiet where you can gather your thoughts.
		PRINTFORMW As you search, you suddenly run into a group of dangerous looking people.
		IF DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 || DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2
		PRINTFORMW You're so scared you feel your bladder about to give up, when one of them looks at you.
		ELSE
		PRINTFORMW You freak out and lose for footing for a bit, before one of them looks at you.
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMW 「Found another one, time to release them」
		PRINTFORMW Before you have a chance to process what's happening, the largest of them swings a mace at you.
		PRINTFORMW Looks like you're not getting out of this one without a fight.

		;make a random one
		CALL MAKE_YUKIZURI(Free_Mob_Slot(), "妖精", 1)
		;bug fix, moved definition here
		DAILY_Lucid_Chara = Free_Mob_Slot(1)
		TARGET = DAILY_Lucid_Chara
		CFLAG:DAILY_Lucid_Chara:デート中 = -1 ;bug fix, disable dating flag

		CALL KOJO_MESSAGE_SEND("DANMAKU", 0, Free_Mob_Slot(1), 1, -1, "戦闘前")
		TEQUIP:Free_Mob_Slot(1):上半身着衣状況 = 1

		CALL CHARA_STATE_TR(Free_Mob_Slot(1))
			DRAWLINE
			CALL COLORMESSAGE(@"Virginity loss history: %CSTR:Free_Mob_Slot(1):処女喪失履歴%",C_PINK,1)
			PRINTFORML 
		CALL DANMAKU_OPPONENT_STATUS(Free_Mob_Slot(1))
		;--------------------
		$Gensokyo2FightLoop
		CALL ASK_M("Fight",1,"Escape",1,"Rules",1)
		SELECTCASE RESULT
			CASE 0
				IF BASE:MASTER:気力 < 500 || BASE:MASTER:体力 < 500
					PRINTFORML %PARSE("You are")% too tired.
					GOTO Gensokyo2FightLoop
				ENDIF
			CASE 1
				PRINTFORML %PARSE("You flee")% from the fight.
				DAILY_Lucid_Stats:9 = 62
				CALL LucidDreamTimeUp()
			CASE 2
				CALL SHOW_DANMAKU_RULE
				GOTO Gensokyo2FightLoop
		ENDSELECT
		CALL KNIFE_FIGHT(Free_Mob_Slot(1),MASTER,0,0)
		IF RESULT > 0
		PRINTFORML The largest of them slams their mace on your head and everything instantly goes dark.
		DAILY_Lucid_Stats:9 = 62
		CALL LucidDreamTimeUp()
		ENDIF
		DAILY_Lucid_Stats:9 = 62
		CALL LucidDreamTimeUp()
		CASE 2
		PRINTFORMW When you open the door, you realize it's a bathroom.
		IF DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 || DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2
			PRINTFORMW At that moment you notice you actually do want to use it, so you pick a stall and relieve your bladder.	
			CALL MasterGoToilet(DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1,DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2,,1)
			IF RESULT <= 0
			DAILY_Lucid_Stats:9 = 0
			CALL LucidDreamTimeUp()
			ENDIF	
			PRINTFORMW As you do, a warm feeling slowly washes over you as the world vanishes.
			DAILY_Lucid_Stats:9 = 0
			CALL LucidDreamTimeUp()
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW However, you don't feel the need to go yet.
		ENDIF
		CASE 3
		SIF !nOmutsu
			RETURN
		PRINTFORMW You walk around, looking for a powerful youkai to ask what's going on, and as you do you run into a large ornate looking building.
		PRINTFORMW Oddly enough, instead of walking into the building, the next thing that happens is you walking out of the building.
		PRINTFORMW You don't understand what just happened, like you lost consciousness for a small period of time.
		PRINTFORMW You decide the building could be dangerous, so you decide to continue looking.
		PRINTFORMW As you walk, you realize people around you are staring and giggling.
		PRINTFORMW You look at yourself and realize you are wearing nothing more than a shirt and a diaper.		
		CALLF PANTY_REWORK_CHANGE(MASTER,103)
		CASE 4
		PRINTFORMW You thinks this has to be one of those things where people are transported to another world and get to go on adventures, slaying dragons and monsters to save the world.
		PRINTFORMW With that in mind, you hurry outside of town to find some monster to fight, when you suddenly run into a small creature you do not recognize.
		PRINTFORMW Thinking it has to be a monster, you kick it with all your might, but the small creature barely moves.
		PRINTFORMW Against your expectations, it suddenly begins to climb out of the ground, showing the gigantic, ferocious looking body that was hiding underground, slowly turning to look at you, realizing you made a mistake...
		PRINTFORMW You lose your footing and fall on your %FSYN("ass")%, \@ DAILY_Lucid_Stats:1 || DAILY_Lucid_Stats:2 ? suddenly beginning to feel warmer #\@ while you continue to look at the enormous creature in front of you.
		PRINTFORMW You close your eyes, the last thing you remember is hearing the creature growling in anger.
		DAILY_Lucid_Stats:9 = 0
		CALL LucidDreamTimeUp()
		CASEELSE
		ENDSELECT
CASE 0
	PRINTFORMW You walk up to %CALLNAME:DAILY_Lucid_Chara% from behind.
	PRINTFORMW Gently tapping %HIS_HER(DAILY_Lucid_Chara)% shoulder, you ask if %HE_SHE(DAILY_Lucid_Chara)% can tell you where you are.
	PRINTFORMW As %CALLNAME:DAILY_Lucid_Chara% turns around, you notice %HIS_HER(DAILY_Lucid_Chara)% skin is bright purple and %HIS_HER(DAILY_Lucid_Chara)% eyes shine yellow, like a bright light bulb was hiding behind %HIS_HER(DAILY_Lucid_Chara)%.
	PRINTFORMW You recoil at such scene, and %CALLNAME:DAILY_Lucid_Chara% looks confused for a moment.
	PRINTFORMW But then %HE_SHE(DAILY_Lucid_Chara)% points towards a nearby building before turning back around and going back on %HIS_HER(DAILY_Lucid_Chara)% way.
	PRINTFORMW You don't really understand what just happened, but you decide to go towards the building you were pointed towards.
ENDSELECT

;----------------------------
;Input names
;----------------------------
@LUCID_DREAM_INPUT_NAMES_21(nCom)
#FUNCTIONS
#DIM nCom
VARSET DAILY_Lucid_ComName
SELECTCASE nCom
CASE 0
	SIF TARGET != MASTER
	DAILY_Lucid_ComName '= @"Ask for Advice"
CASE 1
	DAILY_Lucid_ComName '= @"Move"
ENDSELECT
RETURNF DAILY_Lucid_ComName

